#: ../doc/introduction.rst:23
msgid "OpenShot Video Editor is an award-winning, open-source video editor, available on Linux, macOS, Chrome OS, and Windows. OpenShot can create stunning videos, films, and animations with an easy-to-use interface and rich feature-set."
